    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world of chaos and survival in the game &quot;Last Day to Die&quot;!<br><br>Get ready for continuous battles and strategic decisions in this post-apocalyptic struggle for survival. Embrace the night with weapons in hand, ready to face endless waves of zombies, breathing heavily down your imaginary neck. But don't rest easy during the day - the sun doesn't signify safety. Bandits lurk in the ruins of the city, ready to deprive you of your last resources in a merciless fight for survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/44b6e765d64df93873d019d0432434e3.poster.avif?t=1722533359\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/44b6e765d64df93873d019d0432434e3.webm?t=1722533359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/44b6e765d64df93873d019d0432434e3.mp4?t=1722533359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You and your friends must join forces to obtain gasoline for your transport, which may become your only salvation from this hellish landscape. Traverse the desolate streets, explore abandoned buildings, and challenge everything that stands in your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/f6b50499db746d7e36b7f191f6130354.poster.avif?t=1722533359\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/f6b50499db746d7e36b7f191f6130354.webm?t=1722533359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/f6b50499db746d7e36b7f191f6130354.mp4?t=1722533359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But remember, resources are limited, so every decision, every shot, and every supply must be used wisely. Help each other out, devise strategies, and apply all your skills to stay alive in this unforgiving world.<br><br>Are you ready for the challenge? Don't forget, every sunrise could be your last.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to the world of chaos and survival in the game &quot;Last Day to Die&quot;!<br><br>Get ready for continuous battles and strategic decisions in this post-apocalyptic struggle for survival. Embrace the night with weapons in hand, ready to face endless waves of zombies, breathing heavily down your imaginary neck. But don't rest easy during the day - the sun doesn't signify safety. Bandits lurk in the ruins of the city, ready to deprive you of your last resources in a merciless fight for survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/44b6e765d64df93873d019d0432434e3.poster.avif?t=1722533359\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/44b6e765d64df93873d019d0432434e3.webm?t=1722533359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/44b6e765d64df93873d019d0432434e3.mp4?t=1722533359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You and your friends must join forces to obtain gasoline for your transport, which may become your only salvation from this hellish landscape. Traverse the desolate streets, explore abandoned buildings, and challenge everything that stands in your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/f6b50499db746d7e36b7f191f6130354.poster.avif?t=1722533359\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/f6b50499db746d7e36b7f191f6130354.webm?t=1722533359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876080/extras/f6b50499db746d7e36b7f191f6130354.mp4?t=1722533359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But remember, resources are limited, so every decision, every shot, and every supply must be used wisely. Help each other out, devise strategies, and apply all your skills to stay alive in this unforgiving world.<br><br>Are you ready for the challenge? Don't forget, every sunrise could be your last.",
